  "verbalization": "The visible evidence suggests a complex, multi-step relationship between Npc210544 and CD276 antigen, mediated through different targets. Npc210544 is directly linked to Neuropilin-2, which serves as a target for multiple compounds, including Oblonganoside I, 3,4,5-Trimethoxycinnamic acid, and 5,24-Stigmastadienol acetate. All of these compounds have a shared target of CD276 antigen. This indicates that Npc210544 may influence the activity of these compounds, which in turn affect CD276 antigen. The presence of multiple pathways converging on CD276 antigen suggests a potential role for Npc210544 in modulating the biological effects of these compounds. The integration of these pathways highlights the importance of Neuropilin-2 as a central node in the interaction network, with Npc210544 acting as a potential modulator of the downstream effects on CD276 antigen.",
